    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Antifungal shampoo (eg, ketoconazole 2% or 1%) at least twice a week; because it tends to be chronic and often recurs, long-term use once or twice weekly is often required. Face and folds, milder cases: ketoconazole 2% cream or another imidazole twice daily is often sufficient. Infants, severe cases: ketoconazole 2% or econazole 1% cream"
     }
    ]
   },
